007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§4.4, print pp. 155–165; PDF pp. 177–187; local quotient/finite-index formulation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 3.9, pp. 65–66; scans 73–74"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ind}(L)&lt;\\aleph_0\">\\(\\operatorname{ind}(L)&lt;\\aleph_0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x]_L\">\\([x]_L\\)</span>、商集和指数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f41b3be50448ef3b\" href=\"?note=f41b3be50448ef3b\" title=\"73-df-language-residual-equivalence\">73-df-language-residual-equivalence</a>；DFA 结构见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c0782b725f569c3a\" href=\"?note=c0782b725f569c3a\" title=\"73-df-dfa-structure\">73-df-dfa-structure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\nQ_L\\coloneqq\\Sigma^*/{\\equiv_L},\\qquad F_L\\coloneqq\\{[x]_L:x\\in L\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\nQ_L\\coloneqq\\Sigma^*/{\\equiv_L},\\qquad F_L\\coloneqq\\{[x]_L:x\\in L\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\n\\delta_L\\coloneqq\\{(([x]_L,a),[xa]_L):x\\in\\Sigma^*\\land a\\in\\Sigma\\},\\qquad\\delta_L:Q_L\\times\\Sigma\\to Q_L\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\n\\delta_L\\coloneqq\\{(([x]_L,a),[xa]_L):x\\in\\Sigma^*\\land a\\in\\Sigma\\},\\qquad\\delta_L:Q_L\\times\\Sigma\\to Q_L\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NerodeDFA}(L)\\coloneqq(Q_L,\\Sigma,\\delta_L,[\\varepsilon]_L,F_L),\\qquad\\operatorname{NerodeDFA}(L)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NerodeDFA}(L)\\coloneqq(Q_L,\\Sigma,\\delta_L,[\\varepsilon]_L,F_L),\\qquad\\operatorname{NerodeDFA}(L)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 x≡y，则用后缀 az 展开定义可得 xa≡ya，所以商转移良定义；以空后缀可得同一等价类的成员同时属于或同时不属于 L，故终态集合也与代表元无关。有限指数保证是有限自动机。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-language-residual-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"f41b3be50448ef3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-language-residual-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c0782b725f569c3a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-language-residual-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"f41b3be50448ef3b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$，$\\operatorname{ind}(L)<\\aleph_0$。$[x]_L$、商集和指数见 [[73-df-language-residual-equivalence]]；DFA 结构见 [[73-df-dfa-structure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c0782b725f569c3a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$，$\\operatorname{ind}(L)<\\aleph_0$。$[x]_L$、商集和指数见 [[73-df-language-residual-equivalence]]；DFA 结构见 [[73-df-dfa-structure]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ind}(L)<\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"[x]_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\nQ_L\\coloneqq\\Sigma^*/{\\equiv_L},\\qquad F_L\\coloneqq\\{[x]_L:x\\in L\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\n\\delta_L\\coloneqq\\{(([x]_L,a),[xa]_L):x\\in\\Sigma^*\\land a\\in\\Sigma\\},\\qquad\\delta_L:Q_L\\times\\Sigma\\to Q_L","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nerode\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NerodeDFA}(L)\\coloneqq(Q_L,\\Sigma,\\delta_L,[\\varepsilon]_L,F_L),\\qquad\\operatorname{NerodeDFA}(L)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":true}],"bytes":1944,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-nerode-canonical-dfa|语言等价类构成的规范 DFA]]"},{"id":"ce1461d3e7bc342b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NerodeDFA}(L)$ 见 [[73-df-nerode-canonical-dfa]]，仅在有限指数的语言上调用。"},{"id":"9b1dba6be30381aa","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定字母表 $\\Sigma$。$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)$、$N=(P,\\Sigma,\\eta,p_0,H)$ 是 DFA。$h:Q\\to P$；$\\operatorname{MinimalDFA}_{\\Sigma}$ 与 $\\operatorname{DFAIso}$ 在下式定义。语言、最小化及指数见 [[73-df-dfa-minimization-construction]]、[[73-df-nerode-canonical-dfa]]、[[73-thm-finite-residual-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["f41b3be50448ef3b","c0782b725f569c3a"]}